  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M5
  Title: A path in Current mode
  Summary: With To on Current, the points are offsets from wherever the step starts,
    so the same hop works from anywhere.
  Watch: Ball
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1270109517}
  HowTo: Preview <b>Hop</b>, then <b>Hop Again</b> (which continues from where Hop
    ended). In play mode click the Hop button three times, waiting for each.
  Expect: 'Each hop is the same arch, 90 up and 140 along, starting from wherever
    the ball is: the ball hops along the stage. Home brings it back.'
  Needs: 3
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
