      m_Calls: []
  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> All seven start and finish together on the line. Linear
    moves steadily, OutQuad starts fast, InQuad starts slow, InOutQuad is slow-fast-slow,
    OutBack overshoots then settles, OutBounce bounces, OutElastic springs. The dropdown
    lists Custom Curve first, then Linear and Flash, then one group per direction
    (In, Out, In Out).
