  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M1
  Title: Ease presets
  Summary: The same move with seven ease presets, all 1.2 s long.
  Watch: one dot per ease
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 859484682}
  - {fileID: 710911743}
  - {fileID: 1612326094}
  - {fileID: 89902305}
  - {fileID: 351318151}
  - {fileID: 1026502641}
  - {fileID: 945892879}
  HowTo: Play <b>Race</b>. Then open a step's Ease dropdown.
  Expect: All seven start and finish together on the line. Linear moves steadily,
    OutQuad starts fast, InQuad starts slow, InOutQuad is slow-fast-slow, OutBack
    overshoots then settles, OutBounce bounces, OutElastic springs. The dropdown
    lists Custom Curve first, then Linear and Flash, then one group per direction
    (In, Out, In Out).
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
