  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M7
  Title: A path with no points
  Summary: A shape picked with no points still moves in a straight line, and Disabled
    keeps the points.
  Watch: Ball
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 119870828}
  HowTo: Play <b>Straight</b>. Then add a point with Add Point, set Custom Path to
    <b>Disabled</b>, and back to Curved. Undo afterwards.
  Expect: Straight moves in a plain line. Switching to Disabled hides the point;
    switching back to Curved shows it again with the same value.
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
