  Title: Paths on Size Delta and Scale
  Summary: 'A path can drive a size or a scale too: through a point, the step changes
    one axis, then the other.'
  Watch: Sized, Scaled
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 374804671}
  - {fileID: 1984559826}
  HowTo: 'Play <b>Wide Then Tall</b>, then <b>Back</b>. Open a step: its Edit Path
    in Scene button is greyed (only position steps can be drawn).'
  Expect: Both grow wide first, then tall, at a steady pace, ending square. The Edit
    Path in Scene button is greyed out with a tooltip saying why.
