  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M9
  Title: Play At Custom FPS
  Summary: The same move and turn, smooth and at 8 FPS. Duration 1.3 s is not a whole
    number of 8 FPS frames.
  Watch: Smooth, Stepped
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 34745044}
  - {fileID: 52789603}
  HowTo: Play <b>Smooth</b>, then <b>Stepped</b>, then <b>Back</b>. Look at Stepped's
    Play At Custom FPS row.
  Expect: Stepped jumps in distinct steps, its move and turn ticking together, and
    still lands exactly on its outline, upside down, like Smooth. The row shows the
    tick box with 8 in a box beside it.
