  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M2
  Title: Custom curve
  Summary: 'A hand-drawn curve: 0 is From, 1 is To, and going past them overshoots.'
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 459284433}
  HowTo: Play <b>Wind Up</b>. Then pick <b>Out Quad</b> from the Ease dropdown, play,
    and pick <b>Custom Curve</b> again.
  Expect: 'With the curve: Box backs up a little to the left, rushes right past the
    end outline and settles on it. Out Quad plays a plain slide. Switching back to
    Custom Curve brings the same curve back - nothing was lost either way.'
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
