  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M11
  Title: 'Snapping: All Steps'
  Summary: A slow 30.5-unit creep, smooth and snapped. Snapping rounds positions
    to whole units every frame.
  Watch: Smooth Hero, Snapped Hero; the readout
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 745822092}
  - {fileID: 1102509775}
  - {fileID: 232525411}
  HowTo: Zoom the Scene view right in on the two heroes. Play <b>Creep Smooth</b>,
    then <b>Creep Snapped</b>, watching the readout. Click the Snapping button on
    an animation a few times.
  Expect: Smooth glides; Snapped steps a whole unit at a time, and the readout never
    shows a fraction, even at the end (the move ends half a unit past a whole number).
    The button cycles DISABLED, ALL STEPS, PER STEP.
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
